       "text": "The Auto Chess Official Server will close matchmaking at 07:00 (UTC+8) on September 23, and will begin server shutdown update maintenance at 08:00 (UTC+8). The maintenance is expected to take 4 hours. During maintenance, you will temporarily be unable to log in to the game. The server opening time may be advanced or delayed depending on the actual maintenance progress. Please plan your game time in advance. The details of this update are as follows:",
