      },
      {
       "text": "Obtain 20 Spiral Forgers. Consume (Item Quality) Spiral Forgers to replace an item with a random item of the same quality.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Transforming Common / Uncommon / Rare / Epic / Legendary quality items consumes 1 / 2 / 3 / 4 / 5 Spiral Forgers respectively. Spiral Forgers only last for 10 rounds. After the duration ends, based on the remaining number, there is a chance to drop 0-2 Dormant Crystals.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[Piece Adjustments]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. Nightmare",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[Wrecking Ball]: Wrecking Ball will not disappear after hitting a target; instead, it will seek a new target until the duration ends, when it returns to the caster and restores HP.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Hawk",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[Eagle Eye]: Other allied Hawks will no longer trigger [Eagle Eye] when casting active skills. That is, when multiple Hawks are on the field at the same time, they will no longer trigger each other's [Eagle Eye] skill.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Helicopter",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[Hail of Bullets]: Bonus normal attacks no longer trigger on-hit effects, such as the armor reduction effect from the normal attack of 「Erosion Blade」.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. The Exile",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": ": Illusions now inherit a percentage of the original's current HP. At the same time, Illusions only deal 50% damage; for example, 「Mjollnir」 only deals 100 magic damage.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Max Illusion Count: 3 / 5 / 7 → 5 / 7 / 9",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Secondary Illusion Damage Taken: 200% → 400%",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Clones can no longer be revived by Cave Prodigy.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. Redfox Swordsman",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": ": The skill now always hits, ignoring the target's Evasion effect.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[Item Adjustments]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
