      {
       "text": "2. Azees Gaze",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[Frost Curse]: Removed the effect where damage dealt by the holder reduces the target's Attack by 50%.",
