       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[Battle Adjustment]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. A new option [Money! Money! Money!] has been added to the Relic selection screen. Selecting it will forgo the current Relic choice and grant 10-15 gold at random.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[Relic Alternation]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Temporarily removed relics: Strange Egg Encounter、Pandaman's Pouch、Ares' Helm、Kira's Wand.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. Optimized the interface display and usage process for Relic Chests and Relics.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. New event [Strange Egg & Druid] added. During the event, Strange Eggs will drop from matches. Hatching them grants exquisite skins, which can be claimed to your inventory by consuming an Adoption Certificate",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Veteran/Crown skins now allow selection of any unlocked appearance. After the update, these skins will default to Level 1 form. You may manually switch to other unlocked forms in the Skin interface.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. Added the \"Namecard Decoration\" entry. Players who activated the Senior Pass this season will temporarily be unable to view the Exclusive Namecard Background and Dynamic Namecard Background. These will be obtainable normally for players who activate the Senior Pass in future seasons.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. After the update, players with Drodo's BFF Card will receive an Exclusive Namecard Background. Please check your in-game mail.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "6. Optimizations made to the Summit Clash. A reward system has been added — reach specific Peak scores to earn rewards.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "7. Final Showdown is now a systematic tournament. Once enabled, the Summit Clash entrance in the lobby will be replaced with the Final Showdown entrance.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "8. Optimized recommended items for some chess pieces.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "9. Temporarily disabled the Drodo Brawl mode.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Above is the main content of this update. If you have any questions, please contact customer service (Home Page-upper right Menu-Support). Thank you for your support.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Auto Chess Operation Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
